    "semantic_summary": "EditorGridBehaviour is a specialized RendererBehaviour responsible for rendering a persistent, structured grid overlay within the scene editor. It utilizes a custom shader and mesh pipeline to draw horizontal and vertical lines across the rendering surface. Its primary function is to provide users with a spatial reference system, operating in the RenderLayer.POST_SCENE to ensure visibility over scene geometry."
